// =============================================================================
// Agent Service v2 - Enhanced Agent with Content Library and OVA Support
// =============================================================================
// Purpose: Enhanced version of agent service with content library management,
// OVA import/export, and more comprehensive VM configuration options.
//
// Communication: Mix of unary RPC and streaming (for OVA)
//
// New Features over v1:
// - Content Library: Manage ISOs, templates in central storage
// - OVA Export: Stream VM to OVA file (server -> client)
// - OVA Import: Import VM from OVA file (client -> server)
// - Datastore Management: Create/delete datastores on hosts
// - Enhanced VM Config: More detailed CPU (topology, pinning, NUMA), memory,
//   disk, network configuration
// - Task Management: Track and cancel long-running tasks
// - Host Configuration: Network, storage, time configuration
// - Maintenance Mode: Enter/exit with VM evacuation
// =============================================================================

